# GIMP's system preferences, which it reads before the account's own gimprc,
# so anything set in Preferences still wins. home.nix adds the lines that
# come from the theme. Every key is described in GIMP's own copy of this file:
# etc/gimp/3.0/gimprc in the package.

# No dialog at start, and no help button beside every dialog's own: F1 still
# opens GIMP's manual.
(show-welcome-dialog no)
(show-help-button no)
